    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Professor Grace Edwards has received a prestigious RCM Fellowship. This is an honour given to just a handful of midwives each year.  Grace who is a Professor of Midwifery Education & Practice at the Aga Khan University's School of Nursing and Midwifery in East Africa, has been a midwife for 41 years. She initially started her nurse training in 1974 and then trained as a midwife.",
